<Content Key="bdafe3c5-db03-4a29-a48f-bae7eb727a37" Alias="How Optimizely is evolving to support headless publishing and the composable DXP" Level="3">
  <Info>
    <Parent Key="68beea09-9849-49dd-ac5d-7e5c9b5c9e84">Blog</Parent>
    <Path>/Homepage/Blog/how-optimizely-is-evolving-to-support-headless-publishing-and-the-composable-dxp</Path>
